Vidiyo a na-enye mmeghe nkenke maka ngwaọrụ Arclight.

2
00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.520
Jiri bọtịnụ isi awọ gbanye ya.

3
00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:18.440
Na mbụ, njedebe abụọ nke Arclight nwere ike ịbịa n'otu oge.

4
00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:24.580
Ọ bụrụ na ọ gbanwughị ma ọ bụ ọkụ anaghị anyụ anyụ, batrị nwere ike ịdị larịị.

5
00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:27.360
Jiri chaja USB jikọọ ya.

6
00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:31.240
Mgbe ị na-akwụ ụgwọ, ọkụ ndụ ndụ ga-abịa.

7
00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:37.510
Mgbe nkeji iri na ise gachara, a ga-akwụ ya ụgwọ zuru oke ma rụọ ọrụ ruo ọtụtụ awa.

8
00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:41.390
Ịhapụ ya na ìhè anyanwụ ga-eme ka batrị chajị.

9
00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:44.970
Ị gaghị adị mkpa dochie batrị ma ọ bụ bọlbụ ọ bụla.

10
00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:49.090
Ụdị mgbe njedebe abụọ ahụ batara bụ maka ojiji n'ozuzu ya.

11
00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:54.980
Gbanwee na ọnọdụ anya site na ijide bọtịnụ ala maka 15 sekọnd.

12
00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:59.920
Welite mkpịsị aka gị wee pịa ngwa ngwa ọzọ ka ọkụ na-enwu.

13
00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:04.560
Ị nọ ugbu a na ọnọdụ anya, ebe ophthalmoscope ga-abịa

14
00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:07.940
nke mbụ, mgbe ahụ, akụkụ ihu ihu loupe.

15
00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:13.960
Imegharị usoro ndị a ga-agafe n'ụdị ojiji atọ dị iche iche.

16
00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:15.740
Iji izugbe, anya, wee ntị.

17
00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:20.080
Ozugbo ịhọrọla ọnọdụ kachasị amasị gị, pịa bọtịnụ isi awọ

18
00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:25.520
na-agbanwe otú ọkụ na-enwu na nke njedebe ka ọkụ.

19
00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:30.140
Jide n'aka na ị na-eji njedebe ziri ezi maka nyocha ziri ezi.

20
00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:34.700
A na-enyocha anya mpụga site na iji loupe.

21
00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:41.140
